{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>在《愛‧回家之三代同糖》昨晚（28日）的劇情中，車婉婉獻唱《會過去的》時聲線略帶沙啞，引起網民關注。監製Marco（羅永賢）親自解畫，原來這並非失誤，背後更隱藏著車婉婉抱病上陣的專業故事，以及劇組的特意安排，真相令人動容！</p><p>監製Marco親解畫 揭車婉婉抱病硬撐</p><p>不少細心觀眾留意到，劇中嘉冰（車婉婉飾）在《當年好聲音》海選獻唱時，歌聲沙啞。監製Marco受訪時坦言，這正是他和車婉婉想要的效果。他透露，由於劇集開拍初期需要追趕進度，加上車婉婉的場口較多，導致她一直處於生病狀態。即使身體不適，車婉婉依然非常專業地堅持完成所有拍攝，敬業精神讓監製大為讚賞。</p><p>監製大讚專業：嘉冰唱起嚟有少少瑕疵係應該</p><p>監製Marco進一步解釋，這次錄音的安排是刻意為之。他表示，他們並沒有選擇在專業錄音室進行錄製，因為唱歌的是角色「嘉冰」，而不是專業歌手「車婉婉」。他與車婉婉都有一致共識，認為嘉冰的歌聲帶點瑕疵才更符合角色設定。監製引述當時決定：「因為唱呢隻歌嘅係嘉冰唔係車婉婉，我覺得嘉冰唱起上嚟有少少瑕疵係應該嘅，所以我哋一、兩個 take 就收貨，我同婉婉都覺得嘉冰唱出嚟就應該係咁。」</p><p>網民激讚敬業：難怪把聲咁有感情</p><p>監製揭露幕後故事後，網民對車婉婉的專業態度表示激讚，並對劇組的用心安排給予肯定。許多留言都表示非常佩服，紛紛寫道：「原來係病住唱，真係好專業！respect！」、「難怪把聲咁有感情，原來係真情流露！」、「辛苦婉婉了，要好好保重身體！」、「呢啲就係演員嘅專業精神！將弱點變成特點，好勁！」、「個沙聲效果反而仲好聽，更有故事感。」。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_5679888066a925eb805c36.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_18153313096a925ebaa8660.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_17380333396a925ebf35a49.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_19735602676a925ec2d62b1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_5740031856a925ec61a3d5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_16321399126a925ec99fd15.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_626927426a925eccd64e6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_11537336656a925ecfe63bd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_478546496a925ed29d8fa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_5167060236a925ed5acb68.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_2858346486a925ed8a49a0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_12475518316a925edc582f2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_14067800636a925edf106d2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_6270706756a925ee23a1ae.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_3487625636a925ee579be0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_12173322466a925ee8277b4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_11428787356a925eeb07cb8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_3189668076a925eee243d4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_1460748616a925ef1b0f21.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_13672984896a925ef501b50.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_12396224736a925ef871efa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_8618720196a925efb5be27.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/23_20453344556a925efe33cad.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T04:38:20.317534+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":929,"images":23,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}